# T_SCRR: an import with no memory for the refused lines' box: nothing
# is sent and the message says so.  Then the session ending at the
# import's request (the server gone): the message, then the form and
# the program left with the command it gives, so no key is read after
# it.
K TAB
T imp.csv
K CTRL-S
T Y
S NOMEM
K CTRL-S
T Y
S ENDED
K ENTER
